TEXT -1136 -176 Left 4 ;gan-buck-converter power stage: 48 V to 12 V, IGC033S10S1 x2 (Infineon L1 model) + LM5113-Q1 (behavioural)
TEXT -1136 -112 Left 2 ;Open loop at fixed duty D. Starts in steady state from initial conditions (uic). See README.md for assumptions and how to read the results.
TEXT -1136 -64 Left 2 ;C301 = C301..C303, C304 = C304..C307, C308 = C308+C309, C316 = C316+C317 (DC-bias derated). L_SRC, L_BUS, L_LOOP, L_CSH/L_CSL, L_GH/L_GL are ASSUMED parasitics, not parts.
TEXT -1136 656 Left 2 ;Gate drive: U301 with bootstrap D301/R304/C313, R305 on HOH, 1k + 22p input filters. V3/V4 stand in for the MCU ePWM (3.3 V logic, dead time tdt).
TEXT 704 -64 Left 2 !.param Vin=48 Vdrv=5 Iout=12.5 fsw=400k D=0.2567 tdt=10n Rgon=2\n.param Lloop=1n Lcs=0.15n Lgate=2n Lbus=0.6n Lsrc=1u\n.param Cbulk=2.65u Chf=42n Coc=5.7u\n.param Tsw={1/fsw} Ncyc=10 Nmeas=4 t1={Ncyc*Tsw} t0={(Ncyc-Nmeas)*Tsw}\n.param Vout0=12 Vbst0=4.5 dIL={(Vin-Vout0)*D*Tsw/6.8u} IL0={Iout-dIL/2+0.15} Iin0={Iout*Vout0/Vin}\n.temp 80\n.tran 0 {t1} {t0} 0.25n uic\n.lib infineon_coolgan_100v_g3.lib\n.lib lm5113_behavioral.lib\n.model BAT46W D(Is=1.2u N=1.1 Rs=1.8 Cjo=10p Vj=0.3 M=0.4 BV=100)
TEXT 704 356 Left 2 !.meas tran Vout_avg avg V(V_OUT) from {t0} to {t1}\n.meas tran Vout_ripple_pp pp V(V_OUT) from {t0} to {t1}\n.meas tran IL_avg avg I(L301) from {t0} to {t1}\n.meas tran IL_ripple_pp pp I(L301) from {t0} to {t1}\n.meas tran Vin_hf_ripple_pp pp V(VIN_HF) from {t0} to {t1}\n.meas tran P_Q301 avg (V(D_HS)-V(S_HS))*I(L_LOOP)+(V(G_HS)-V(S_HS))*I(L_GH) from {t0} to {t1}\n.meas tran P_Q302 avg (V(SW_NODE)-V(S_LS))*(I(L_CSL)-I(L_GL))+(V(G_LS)-V(S_LS))*I(L_GL) from {t0} to {t1}\n.meas tran P_cell_in avg V(VIN_HF)*I(L_LOOP) from {t0} to {t1}\n.meas tran P_to_vout avg V(V_OUT)*I(L301) from {t0} to {t1}\n.meas tran P_driver avg -V(P5SRC)*I(V2) from {t0} to {t1}\n.meas tran Efficiency param P_to_vout/(P_cell_in+P_driver)\n.meas tran Vsw_max max V(SW_NODE) from {t0} to {t1}\n.meas tran Vsw_min min V(SW_NODE) from {t0} to {t1}\n.meas tran Vds_Q301_max max V(D_HS)-V(S_HS) from {t0} to {t1}\n.meas tran Vds_Q302_max max V(SW_NODE)-V(S_LS) from {t0} to {t1}\n.meas tran Vgs_Q301_max max V(G_HS)-V(S_HS) from {t0} to {t1}\n.meas tran Vgs_Q301_min min V(G_HS)-V(S_HS) from {t0} to {t1}\n.meas tran Vgs_Q302_max max V(G_LS)-V(S_LS) from {t0} to {t1}\n.meas tran Vgs_Q302_min min V(G_LS)-V(S_LS) from {t0} to {t1}\n.meas tran Vgs_Q302_bump_while_off max (V(G_LS)-V(S_LS))*u(1-V(LS_DRIVE)) from {t0} to {t1}\n.meas tran Vbst_avg avg V(HB)-V(SW_NODE) from {t0} to {t1}\n.meas tran Vbst_min min V(HB)-V(SW_NODE) from {t0} to {t1}
